<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu sharply lower on profit warning.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu sharply lower on profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish metals and mining group Outokumpu Oy fell sharply on Monday after the group released a profit warning but volume was modest, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1450/1150 GMT, Outokumpu traded at a four-week low 80.00 markka, down 4.50 markka or more than five percent. Trade was only 1.7 million markka.</p>
<p>Outokumpu said its May-August result would be clearly weaker than its January-April profit and that this year's full-year profit would be significantly lower than in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
